<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Healthsouth started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Healthsouth started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Healthsouth Corp as strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said expects Healthsouth to earn $0.93 a share in 1997 and $1.14 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $29.</p>
